body = "Security log, 03:21\n\nThe power dip stalled the freight shutter during feeding. Two animals forced it. One crossed the security gate before it fell shut and went toward the condensate line. The other doubled back to freight.\n\nThe freight bulkhead is shut now. The lift still takes the keycard."

